  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "**The Pool is closed until March 6, 2026 for renovations.**<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements <br>Three Story Home<br>1st Floor | Master, King Bed<br>2nd Floor | Sleeper Sofa (Living Room) <br>3rd Floor | Guest 1, Queen Bed; Guest 2, Twin Over Full Bunk Bed w/Twin Trundle<br><br>Parking: This property offers two parking spots, providing easy and reliable access for guests throughout their stay.<br><br>Experience Your Vacation Haven<br><br>Located in a private area across from Camp Helen State Park is the idyllic community of Grande Pointe at Inlet Beach. This coastal neighborhood features Vitamin Sea, a three story home that has plenty of room for the whole group! With three floors of space, multiple balconies, a private community pool, and a 15-minute walk to the shoreline, this is the perfect place for families and friend groups, large and small, to enjoy Gulf life together.<br><br>On the first and third floors, you’ll find all the comforts of home with modern touches to make your guests feel rested, relaxed, and pampered. The first floor features the master bedroom with king bed and spa-like en suite bath equipped with a double vanity, oversized walk-in tile shower, and separate soaker tub. On the third floor, you’ll find 2 guest bedrooms and a loft space for more room. This floor also features a full bath with tub/shower combo and a balcony to enjoy slow morning starts. Sleeping up to 9 comfortably, this is the home to make lasting memories!<br><br>The main living space is located on the second floor of the home and features an open concept floorplan. The kitchen is equipped with stainless steel appliances, stone countertops, a breakfast bar, and a walk-in pantry to store everything you need. With a brand new fence installed in the backyard, this home is perfect for pets! After a long day, relax in the living room, featuring a 65” flat screen TV, or head out to your private balcony. Equipped with chairs, table, sofa, and a gas grill, enjoy the views of the lush Florida landscape as the sun sets over the Gulf.<br><br>While this beachside gem is a dream, make sure to explore the area, as you are minutes away from Rosemary Beach and Seaside.<br><br>Guest Walk-Through<br>Three Story Unit<br>1st Floor—Master Bedroom, Full Bath, Desk/Workspace, Garage<br>2nd Floor—Kitchen, Dining Room, Living Room, Half Bath, Laundry, Balcony<br>3rd Floor—2 Bedrooms, Loft w/Den, Full Bath, Balcony<br><br>Unit Amenities- Laundry, Garage, Multiple Balconies, 2 beach cruiser bicycles, Gas Grill<br>Community Amenities- Private dock, Community pool, Clubhouse<br><br>About the Community of Grande Pointe<br>The idyllic Grande Pointe neighborhood is located between Rosemary Beach and Panama City Beach, abutting the lush greenery of Camp Helen State Park. This beachside community offers its guest a relaxing atmosphere to enjoy the beauty and tranquility of Gulf living. Grande Pointe features a heated community pool, a dock on Lake Powell, and a community pavilion featuring an amenity center and gathering space with full kitchen. While the neighborhood is a dream, you are less than a 5 minute drive away from the sugar white sands of Inlet Beach and various food options, outlet malls, and golf courses. Whether you like to spend your vacation on the shoreline or in the air conditioning, Grande Pointe has it all! Amenities such as golf, tennis, biking, boating, water sports & more are available locally at additional costs.<br> <br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet<br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.<br><br>Pet Friendly Unit <br>Pets are welcome here! Please note it is an additional $300 for one pet, $400 for two pets, plus taxes and admin fee.",
